# --- CONFIGURATION ---
# Copy the live tokens printed in your gateway terminal and paste them below:
@user_token = PASTE_LIVE_USER_TOKEN_HERE
@admin_token = PASTE_LIVE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Request public endpoint anonymously (Should succeed: /users requires no roles)
GET http://localhost:8080/users/profile/1

### 2. Request protected orders endpoint anonymously (Should fail: 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/checkout

### 3. Request protected orders endpoint with invalid token (Should fail: 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_xyz

### 4. Request protected orders endpoint with valid user token (Should succeed: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 5. Request admin status with standard user token (Should fail: 403 Forbidden - Role mismatch)
GET http://localhost:8080/_admin/status
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 6. Request admin status with admin token (Should succeed: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/_admin/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}